==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|enm|en}} {{term|nepe|lang=enm}}, from {{etyl|ang|en}} {{term|næp|lang=ang}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|napus|lang=la}}.

Cognate to {{term|turnip}}.

